msgid "TOME_SKULLS@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Blood Cult"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"\"Blood of our enemies are our nutrients - it is our currency. It belongs to "
"us! Those who see our practices as diabolical or unethical do not understand "
"the importance of being the fittest in this world of the damned! Everyone is "
"thirsty for blood whether it be revenge or 'justice.' We just embrace it and "
"put the blood in good use.\""

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Bloodletter General, Sagath"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Revel in the madness of warfare. Let blood fill the goblet of the Lord of "
"Murder and pile high the skulls of all who dare stand before you."

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Bloodletter"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A Ferocious Fighter unit that revels in the blood of his enemies."

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@UNIT1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Gore Cleave"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@UNIT1@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Deal damage in a 1-hex cone."

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Bloodletting Focus"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Enchanted units, except <<m:{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE.Hyperlink}>>, "
"gain the following effects:[bulletlist][bullet/]Base {GLOBAL.MeleeConcept."
"Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.RangedConcept.Hyperlink} attacks gain base 60% chance "
"of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VEC_SOUL_BLEED.Hyperlink} against units "
"immune to {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLEEDING.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Gain 2 {GLOBAL."
"UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} when attacking someone who is {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.BLEEDING.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]\n"
"<<m:{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE.Hyperlink}>> gain the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"VECTRA_ABSORB_BLOOD.Hyperlink} ability.\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for Single Shot attacks."

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Blood Ripple"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Units in a 1 hex radius sustain:[bulletlist][bullet/]25 {GLOBAL."
"PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLEEDING."
"Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Sagath's Ritual"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Friendly units in a 1-hex radius:[bulletlist][bullet/]2 <<m:{GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.VECTRA_DAEMON_LAYER.Hyperlink}>>[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"VECTRA_DAEMON_COAT.Hyperlink} for 2 turns[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BERSERK."
"Hyperlink}[bullet/]Units with {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VECTRA_DAEMON_COAT."
"Hyperlink} are restored 20 {GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink} "
"instead of going Berserk."

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Vessels of Blood"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Your race becomes vessels of adrenaline and lovers of blood, your race gains:"
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Melee attackers have 60% chance to be inflicted with "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLEEDING.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL.ResistanceConcept."
"Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Cities of this race gains +1 {GLOBAL."
"UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_6@NAME"
msgstr "Sanguine Cult"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@SKILL_6@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For each concurrent war, gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL."
"UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept."
"Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]Grants {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.INSPIRING_KILLER."
"Hyperlink} to every {GLOBAL.UnitConcept.Hyperlink} produced in this {GLOBAL."
"CityConcept.Hyperlink}.\n"
"+2 {GLOBAL.StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink} per {GLOBAL."
"PopulationConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@HERO_SKILL@NAME"
msgstr "Fight to the Death"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@HERO_SKILL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target enemy and the caster are both taunted by each other for 3 {GLOBAL."
"TurnConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@NAME"
msgstr "[forester/] Daemon Forge"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+3 {GLOBAL."
"UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent Ashlands {GLOBAL."
"ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.ForesterConcept.Hyperlink}."
"[bullet/]+3 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent Ashlands {GLOBAL."
"ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.ForesterConcept.Hyperlink}."
"[bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.ForesterConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]{GLOBAL."
"UnitConcept.Hyperlink} deployment location."

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@UNIT1@NAME"
msgstr "Bloodletter"

msgid "TOME_SKULLS@UNIT1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "A Ferocious Fighter unit that revels in the blood of his enemies."

msgid "VISIT_PROVINCE@SKULLS@NAME"
msgstr "Blood Transfusion"

msgid "VISIT_PROVINCE@SKULLS@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Inflict 24 {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink} to a {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"BLEEDING.Hyperlink} enemy unit and heal all allies within 1-hex of them 15 "
"{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}. Must be an ally within range of "
"the target to use this ability."

msgid "Bloodletter@DaemonCoat@Name"
msgstr "Daemon Cloak"

msgid "Bloodletter@DaemonCoat@Description"
msgstr ""
"At the start of this unit's turn, gain 2 <<m:{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"VECTRA_DAEMON_LAYER.Hyperlink}>>."

msgid "Bloodletter@DaemonLayer@Name"
msgstr "Tough Layer"

msgid "Bloodletter@DaemonLayer@Description"
msgstr ""
"Gain +1 {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.ResistanceConcept."
"Hyperlink}. Lose a stack when hit. Stacks up to 2x. This cannot be dispelled "
"by normal means."

msgid "Bloodletter@Lore@Name"
msgstr "Lore - Bloodletter"

msgid "Bloodletter@Lore@Description"
msgstr ""
"The Bloodletters are greatly praised in the Blood Cult. They possess what "
"they call \"The Touch of Hell.\" The mounts they ride are changed into "
"Nightmarish variants of themselves striking fear in their enemies. \n"
"\n"
"The Touch of Hell is branded upon them via the Sanguine Cult Ritual which "
"consists of magic and an individual who is able to drink large amounts of "
"blood of different blood types and withstand any medical complications. "
"Those who can't are treated and healed but those who can are titled "
"\"Bloodletter\" possessing a fiendish power some can only dream of. \n"
"\n"
"With this same power, their very presence can pull from the ground around "
"them to create what is called \"Daemon Coat.\" These abilities, along with "
"the ritual, was first discovered by a Bloodletter King by the name of Sagath "
"with the help of his Jester Skald to not only revel in blood... but to "
"command it."

msgid "TOME_SKULL@STATUS1@NAME"
msgstr "Soul Bleeding"

msgid "TOME_SKULL@STATUS1@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Same as {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLEEDING.Hyperlink} but ignores those with "
"bleeding immunity\n"
"\n"
"Only applicable to units with immunity to bleeding"

msgid "TOME_SKULL@SOULBLEED@MODIFIER@DESC"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Base {SOUL_BLEED_RES>ResolvedStrength}% chance to "
"inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VEC_SOUL_BLEED.Hyperlink} for 3 <<m:{GLOBAL."
"TurnConcept}>>[bullet/]Gain 2 {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink} when "
"attacking someone who is {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BLEEDING.Hyperlink}["
